Z||000000||I wish I had a GT||12-10-2001||11:42 PM||||Now granted im not serious...of cource its OK to like the notchback but most everyone I talk to thinks its the worst looking fiero model.<P>I like it the best..am I crazy? also curious...does the lack of the fastback piece save on weight?  hurt on aero dynamics?  I'm guessing yes on both.  I'd like to get some forum feedback..how about the notchbacK?<P>------------------<BR>**I wish I had a GT**||||reg||1
