Z||000002||FieroMaster88||12-10-2001||11:49 PM||||Nope...you aren't crazy!  I love my notchback!  Everyone thinks the notchbacks have the 4cyl and the fastbacks have the v6, so I always surprise them!  As far as weight, I think it is a little lighter.  Not sure how much, but some.  Don't think it affects aerodynamics though!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieromaster88sig.gif">  <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
