Z||000004||XDrewX||12-10-2001||11:52 PM||||I used to think notchbacks were ugly, I had two GT's.<BR>Guess what.................<BR>I now have two notchbacks.<BR>I sold the GT's and bought better notchbacks.<P>There are always notchback cars in the local yards, hardley ever GT's.  At least it is that way where I live.<P>I think notchbacks are easier to get access to the engine from the side....at least for short people.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I think the SE model is the best notchback.<P>Peace||||reg||1
